jet sub-structure with respect to p+p collisions (i.e. when the jet propagates through vacuum). Such measurement is experimentally very challenging, because there are many photons created in different processes, mainly Dalitz decays of \(\pi^{0}\) mesons and conversion photons, created by charged particles passing through material of the detector.

