The \(p_{\rm T}\) dependency of the TPC and TOF PID efficiency of \(\rm K^{\pm}\) mesons is plotted in Fig. 4.22. Again, the data are fitted with a constant function in order to determine the final PID efficiency. In this case, the constant fit gives good approximation for both the TPC and TOF.

