\begin{tabular}{l l l} \hline
**Decay Channel** & \(c\tau\) [\(\mu\)m] & \(BR\) [\%] \\ \hline \(\text{D}^{+}\to\text{K}^{-}\pi^{+}\pi^{+}\) & \(311.8\pm 2.1\) & \(9.46\pm 0.24\) \\ \(\text{D}^{0}\to\text{K}^{-}\pi^{+}\) & \(122.9\pm 0.4\) & \(3.93\pm 0.04\) \\ \(\text{D}^{+}_{\text{s}}\to\text{d}\eta\pi^{+}\to\text{K}^{-}\text{K}^{+}\pi^{+}\) & \(149.9\pm 2.1\) & \(2.27\pm 0.08\) \\ \(\Lambda^{+}_{\text{c}}\to\text{K}^{-}\pi^{+}\text{p}\) & \(59.9\pm 1.8\) & \(6.35\pm 0.33\) \\ \hline \end{tabular}
