The invariant spectrum of the \(\mathrm{D^{\pm}}\) mesons is then calculated from the raw yield \(Y_{\mathrm{raw}}\) as:

\[\frac{\mathrm{d^{2}}N}{2\pi p_{\mathrm{T}}\mathrm{d}p_{\mathrm{T}}\mathrm{d}y}= \frac{1}{2\pi p_{\mathrm{T}}}\frac{Y_{\mathrm{raw}}}{N_{\mathrm{evt}}BR\Delta p _{\mathrm{T}}\Delta y\varepsilon(p_{\mathrm{T}})}, \tag{2}\]

